WEBVTT

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:09.560
It doesn't even look close!

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.520
"Pay Stub" "Yomogi Asanaka"

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.850
Whew, that's a lot.

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:55.310
Hey, Freshman. You pick up more shifts?
Helping the family out?

00:00:55.310 --> 00:01:00.060
Oh, it's nothing like that.
Just wanted some spending money.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.650
Aha.

00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:03.730
Well, I'll get going.

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:31.600
We've gotta decide our project?
It's only May.

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:33.100
When's the festival?

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:35.440
Second week of October.

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:36.520
That's way off.

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:37.600
Ain't it?

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:39.350
How about a haunted house?

00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:41.440
I heard they were banned.

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:42.440
Why?

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:44.310
Ghosts might show up.

00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:45.310
--Serious?
--What?

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:46.650
Gimme a break.

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:51.350
No, I'm serious. Years back,
some teased student offed themselves.

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:54.150
If we cooked food, what should we do?

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:54.810
Huh? Who teases in high school?

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:54.810
Meat skewers.

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:56.560
I know, right?

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:55.730
Fried food?

00:01:55.730 --> 00:01:56.560
In class?

00:01:56.560 --> 00:01:57.980
Why not?!

00:02:01.310 --> 00:02:06.020
♪ Now, ♪

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:10.650
♪ go and soar. ♪

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:10.650
Whoa. That's dangerous.

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:12.150
It's Minami.

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:14.520
What's she doing up there?

00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:19.400
Speaking of her...

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:20.980
I heard it, too.

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:21.850
What?

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:25.650
I guess she's asked a bunch of guys out.

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:27.980
Huh? She's that kinda girl?

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:34.350
She asks 'em out and ditches 'em like
some sort of promise-breaking affliction.

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:35.770
The hell's that?

00:02:35.770 --> 00:02:38.400
It's just a rumor.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:41.020
I can't picture her like that.

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:43.350
You're so pure, Yomogi.

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:45.350
What's that mean?

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:55.360
What's a Kaiju User?

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:55.360
Episode 1

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:58.560
I heard all about it, Yume.

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:00.690
About what?

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:04.560
You asked a 2nd-year
to meet you and ditched him.

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:08.060
Yeah. He went off on me yesterday.

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:11.690
You know, that kinda stuff gets around.

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:12.730
Yeah.

00:03:12.730 --> 00:03:18.480
I hate to say it, but don't you know
your class talks about you?

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:22.440
Since you're not in my class,
why even care?

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:27.060
I've known you forever,
so I'm saying it for your own good.

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:29.400
Why, thanks, Mom.

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.100
Cut it out.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:36.440
Yume. Stop making promises you won't keep.

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:40.310
Hello?

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:43.900
Don't ignore me.

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:46.650
About the different lines of thinking...

00:03:46.650 --> 00:03:51.020
There's Stoic Asceticism
and Epicurus' Hedonism.

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:54.650
These two are like night and day.

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:55.650
In this class--

00:03:55.650 --> 00:04:00.520
Year-over-year, more tombs
are being dismantled.

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:05.310
Hmm? Senpai, the memorial is next week.

00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:06.400
Huh?

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:10.440
Ugh, you're right.

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:13.520
Good luck explaining you're unemployed.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:15.810
Says the one who skips school.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:21.440
That's different! I don't attend
school purely by choice.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:24.520
This may very well be the new "grave."

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:26.650
That's different?

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:28.230
Bye, bye.

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:29.690
Later.

