00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:57.060
Um, are you okay?

00:04:58.060 --> 00:04:59.440
Starving...

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:04.020
Starving? R-Right. Um...

00:05:05.060 --> 00:05:09.770
H-Here. It's leftovers from lunch,
but if you want it...

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:10.770
Whoa!

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:17.230
Well, I'll be going now.

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:28.060
You... saved my life.

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:29.060
Huh?

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:30.940
No, for real.

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:33.770
I'm glad you're feeling better.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:35.940
What's your name?

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:36.850
Huh?

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:38.100
Your name!

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:42.400
My name? I-It's Yomogi Asanaka.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.650
Yomogi, huh?

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:48.230
That's a good name.

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:49.980
Thank you.

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:53.600
I'm Gauma, a <i>kaiju</i> user.

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:55.900
<i>Kaiju</i> ? Okay...

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:58.060
As for why I'm here...

00:05:58.060 --> 00:06:00.270
Can you just let me go?

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:03.940
Thanks. I swear I'll return the favor.

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:07.730
Uh, it's actually fine
if you don't, so...!

00:06:09.230 --> 00:06:11.190
Yomogi!

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:19.730
Yomogi, let's go!

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.190
Okay!

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:23.350
We'll be back later, Mom.

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:24.190
Hmm?

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:27.270
We're having dinner with Kamijo.

00:06:27.270 --> 00:06:28.690
Mmm.

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:30.600
Yomogi, let's go!

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:31.520
Mmm.

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:33.440
You're so loud.

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:34.810
Say something?

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:36.600
So loud.

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:41.150
It's good for the earth!

00:06:41.150 --> 00:06:43.810
Yomogi, you're now in...?

00:06:43.810 --> 00:06:44.730
High school.

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:48.230
Yeah, thought so. Which is why...

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:50.230
Here. Congrats.

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:52.470
Entering 
School 
Gift

00:06:50.230 --> 00:06:51.220
Huh? Um...

00:06:50.230 --> 00:06:52.440
What? My goodness!

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:56.060
Because you'll be
going out more, you know?

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:58.940
You shouldn't have, but thanks.

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:01.440
Thank you.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.480
...and it talks automatically.

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:08.690
What are you doing, Yomogi? Let's go!

