00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:17.230
It's another day in the life
of this big family.

00:07:17.230 --> 00:07:19.100
The Hinode's morning starts...

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:20.690
Thanks for the meal.

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:29.100
Oh. Can I go in Kano's room?
I wanna borrow something.

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:30.400
What?

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:33.270
A book for school.

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:35.900
Sure, as long as you return it.

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:37.350
Yeah.

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:40.480
It's not like she's going to need it.

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:45.190
Honey!

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:46.100
Huh?

00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:50.900
Clean up after yourself
before you start drinking.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.440
There it is.

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:52.230
Yume.

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:58.290
Respect for the Aged Day

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:58.290
Recital

00:07:55.310 --> 00:07:58.230
Yume, I'd like you to come.

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:00.600
Why?

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:05.850
Clean up, huh?

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:10.020
It's about time you cleaned up, too.

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:11.310
Cleaned what?

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:14.230
Kano's room. Enough is enough.

00:08:14.230 --> 00:08:16.310
What do you want from me?

00:08:16.310 --> 00:08:19.480
According to the police,
at around 6 O'clock...

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:18.680
Owner

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:18.680
When I drove out of the lot,
my car started floating!

00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:23.440
Whoa. Check this out, Senpai.

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:25.190
Garbage was floating...

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:30.650
Hey, Senpai! Senpai!
Hey, hey, hey! Senpai!

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:35.480
And he grabbed me by the leg.

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:37.480
Whoa. Freaky.

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:39.910
Almost thought he'd eat me.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:41.600
Hey! Yomogi!

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:44.060
Hey!

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:46.650
Shoot! I'm going ahead!

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:49.170
Huh? Who's that?

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:50.020
Hey, hey! Yomogi! It's me!

00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:52.230
Looks like he's having fun.

00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:15.270
Um...

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:16.650
Yeah?

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:19.690
Do you have time after school?

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:21.440
Huh? Today?

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:22.770
Yes.

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:24.270
Uh, um...

00:09:24.270 --> 00:09:26.900
Minami. Yume Minami.

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:30.230
Yeah, I know. You're in my class.

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:33.350
Oh, yeah.

00:09:33.350 --> 00:09:36.100
I've gotta go to work tonight.

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:37.310
I see.

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:40.350
Oh, but I'll be done at eight.

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:43.770
Then, can you meet me here at nine?

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:46.650
Sure, but why?

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:52.310
Um... I thought if anyone,
maybe you would hear me out.

00:09:56.350 --> 00:09:58.560
You saw me here, right?

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:00.600
Uh, yeah.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:02.980
Heard the rumors about me?

00:10:02.980 --> 00:10:04.350
Huh? No.

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:10.230
You don't have to pretend.
You don't believe me, though?

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:12.400
No, that's not true.

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:15.900
Good. I'll see you here. It's a promise.

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:16.670
Yeah.

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:17.980
Hey!

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:20.560
Yomogi!

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:22.400
What?

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:24.690
Why do you keep running from me?!

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:24.690
See you at nine! Bye!

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.690
Wait up, Yomogi!

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:36.850
You a friend of Yomogi's?

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:52.560
Hey, Freshman. Dinner later?

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:53.600
Today?

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:55.310
It's my treat.

00:10:55.310 --> 00:10:58.690
Oh, sorry. I've got plans.

00:10:59.650 --> 00:11:01.400
Ooh! So naughty!

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:04.230
What is? What?!

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:26.940
Hey, Senpai! It's nearby,
so let's go check it out!

00:11:26.940 --> 00:11:28.020
What?

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:31.850
The floating car or beer or whatever.

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:33.100
Ugh.

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:36.650
C'mon, let's go see it!

00:11:36.650 --> 00:11:40.150
The police get nosy
when I walk around with you.

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:42.940
Whatever! Let's go outside!

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:44.190
Ugh.

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:48.520
Why does no one believe we're cousins?

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:57.270
Wednesday, May 27

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:57.270
Wednesday, May 27

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:57.770
She didn't come.

00:11:57.770 --> 00:12:01.690
I thought if anyone,
maybe you would hear me out.

00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:08.350
For real?

00:12:08.350 --> 00:12:10.940
We meet again, Yomogi.

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:14.980
What are you doing here?

00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:17.980
What are you doing?

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:20.440
Can you just drop it?

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:26.600
It's raining. You'll catch a cold.

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:30.810
You waiting for someone?

00:12:32.650 --> 00:12:35.850
Oh, her! The girl from this morning?!

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:36.900
Nope.

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:40.100
I knew it! She your girlfriend?

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:42.020
No way.

00:12:42.020 --> 00:12:44.560
What time you supposed to meet?

00:12:46.310 --> 00:12:48.020
What time?!

00:12:48.020 --> 00:12:49.480
Nine.

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:55.730
Whoa! She's 40 minutes late!
You not gonna search for her?!

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:57.060
Search?!

00:12:57.060 --> 00:13:02.270
Fine, I'll go search for her!
'Cuz I owe you one!

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:21.770
There you are!

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:24.980
Hey, hey, hey! Hey, you!

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:26.600
Who are you?

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:31.650
You saw me before!
I'm Gauma, a <i>kaiju</i> user.

00:13:31.650 --> 00:13:33.400
What's your name?

00:13:36.270 --> 00:13:40.270
You made a promise with Yomogi.
Why are you here?

00:13:40.270 --> 00:13:41.850
You're way late.

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:44.560
H-Hey! Where are you going?!

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:46.060
Wait up!

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:50.190
It's none of your business.

00:13:50.190 --> 00:13:51.440
It is!

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:58.060
You...

00:13:58.060 --> 00:14:02.060
You tricked Yomogi?

00:14:02.060 --> 00:14:07.060
You weren't gonna go, but you
made him wait? You toying with him?

00:14:09.020 --> 00:14:11.600
And what if I was?

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:16.310
Then we've got a huge damn problem!

00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:21.650
Yomogi's been waiting in the rain!
The dude might even catch a cold!

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:23.100
Shut up.

00:14:23.100 --> 00:14:25.190
You shut up!

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:27.440
--Listen here!
--Too close!

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:33.810
In this world, there're three things
important for people to keep:

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:40.560
Promises... Uh,
and you know... Love, and...

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:41.770
Can I leave?

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:43.730
I ain't finished yet!

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:45.190
Minami?

00:14:46.560 --> 00:14:48.400
Yomogi...

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:51.270
Yomogi! You're being tricked!

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:52.100
Huh?

00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:57.100
By her! She wasn't gonna
keep her promise from the start!

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:59.190
What? Meaning...?

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:02.560
She's toying with you and tricked you!

00:15:03.690 --> 00:15:07.100
...like some sort of
promise-breaking affliction.

00:15:08.480 --> 00:15:10.150
Is it true?

00:15:12.600 --> 00:15:13.520
It's true.

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:17.600
Seriously?! I can't believe you!

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:19.850
Something wrong with you?

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:24.350
Something is wrong with me.

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:50.310
What?

00:15:50.310 --> 00:15:54.810
Hey, hey, hey! It's here! It's a big one!

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:03.730
No use. I can't control the <i>kaiju</i> .

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:05.100
<i>Kaiju?</i>

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:12.150
It's glowing! It's ringing!

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:14.770
See?! Look! Something's moving!

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:15.600
Where?

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:19.230
Argh! I can't get a good photo!

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:22.480
If I lost my power as a <i>kaiju</i> user...

00:16:22.480 --> 00:16:24.650
Hey! Be careful!

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:28.400
...then I'll just have to use this!

00:16:42.190 --> 00:16:47.650
Whoa! This one's up close!
It's super pretty!

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:49.600
Shoot! It looked at me!

00:16:49.600 --> 00:16:51.400
Where are its eyes?

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:54.270
It's coming this way!

00:16:54.270 --> 00:16:55.450
Run!

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:57.020
Wait! Wait, wait, wait!

00:16:57.020 --> 00:16:58.440
Wait!

00:16:58.440 --> 00:17:01.310
H-Huh?! Senpai!

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:07.440
Is he... dead?

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:09.940
Unemployed and dead.

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:13.560
Ouch!

00:17:15.190 --> 00:17:18.100
Um, what is this? Huh?!

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:21.020
Minami? Where are we?

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:22.600
Yomogi?

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:26.850
I guess you need
four people to make it move.

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:30.690
Four? Huh? When did he get here?

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:32.270
Make what move?

00:17:32.270 --> 00:17:34.810
Dy... na... zenon.

00:17:34.810 --> 00:17:39.190
Was it you who took us in?
Is that your name?

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:43.900
That's a good name!

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:49.770
Dynazenon?

00:17:49.770 --> 00:17:50.590
Let's go!

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:52.060
Huh? Where?

00:17:53.980 --> 00:17:57.480
Um! Holy shit! Holy shit! Holy shit!

00:17:57.480 --> 00:18:00.100
Senpai!

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:13.060
Found it!

00:18:13.060 --> 00:18:15.100
It really <i>is</i> a <i>kaiju</i> !

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:33.690
This <i>kaiju</i> ...! Is it <i>them</i> ?!

00:18:33.690 --> 00:18:37.270
In that case, let's do this
before it runs wild!

00:18:37.270 --> 00:18:42.060
Dynazenon! Battle, Go!

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:50.810
Huh? Should I be doing something?

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:52.190
Quit touching stuff!

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:53.650
S-Sorry!

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.150
I'll try my luck!

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:56.440
Huh? Try?

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:59.150
Yeah! This is my first time!

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:06.060
Whoa!

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:10.600
Are you alive? Senpai, hello?
Are you alive?!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:10.600
Chise? I dunno what's going on.

00:19:16.440 --> 00:19:20.600
What the hell? Wh-Whoa!

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:25.480
Shit! Is this the <i>kaiju's</i> power?!

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:32.440
Ow, ow! Shit!

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:40.270
Huh? Did we make it angry?

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:42.190
How can you tell, Yomogi?

00:19:42.190 --> 00:19:43.770
Just look at it!

00:19:43.770 --> 00:19:46.020
Huh? You guys know each other?

00:19:46.020 --> 00:19:48.770
Wait, who are you anyway?!

00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:55.980
Dynazenon... What exactly are you?

00:19:55.980 --> 00:19:59.520
Before we're beat,
show us what you're made of!

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:39.650
Th-That stopped it!

00:20:39.650 --> 00:20:44.650
Is this Dynazenon's true power?! Dyna Rex!

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:25.020
Eat this!

00:21:25.020 --> 00:21:30.770
Blazing Inferno Rex Roar!

00:21:57.850 --> 00:22:00.560
Hello, Senpai?! You alive?!

00:22:00.560 --> 00:22:03.900
I dunno, but I think it's over.

00:22:03.900 --> 00:22:06.400
What... just happened?

00:22:07.440 --> 00:22:09.810
Minami, you okay?!

00:22:11.100 --> 00:22:14.560
Something is wrong with me.
